WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for the walkthrough: How to use this builder

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.660
So this part of the site is a quick
tool for turning what matters

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.090
to your family into a realistic
language plan.

3
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.370
And one thing to keep in mind before
you start using this tool,

4
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:16.230
this builder isn't about finding a
perfect language strategy.

5
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.530
So please don't be stressed out by
this.

6
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.540
So this builder is going to ask you
six questions about what your

7
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.220
family can realistically do right
now.

8
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.290
Which language do you want to grow
or protect?

9
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.390
Who speaks this language?

10
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.650
What support does your family
already have?

11
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.570
And where this plan could fit
naturally into your week.

12
00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.870
At the end, you'll have a starting
plan.

13
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.690
One reason that this language
matters to your family,

14
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.770
one routine or a couple of routines
to try,

15
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.700
one person that you can involve, and
a date to check back in.

16
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.510
So you can print this plan or save
it.

17
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:57.650
You could try it for a few weeks and
adjust it as your family changes.

18
00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:59.710
This is just a starting plan.

19
00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.390
It's supposed to be dynamic.

20
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.080
So take all the stress off.
